== Trivia ==
* Forget me not is a common name for the flower genus Myosotis. This name comes from a [[wikipedia:Vergißmeinnicht, WAB 93|German poem]] where it symbolizes remembrance of a loved one.
* This trinket originated in ''Antibirth''. It was originally capped at 8 pickups instead of 4.

